WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:02.544
What do you even know about Zero?

00:00:02.794 --> 00:00:05.338
Then tell me
what you know about him!

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.298
Tell me where Zero is now!

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:20.145
Come on, answer me!
Where is Zero?

00:00:20.520 --> 00:00:22.564
I won't tell a traitor like you!

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:24.566
Then let's finish this here!

00:00:25.150 --> 00:00:26.985
Don't get so full of yourself,
just because you can fly!

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:32.657
I've got you!

00:00:33.658 --> 00:00:34.743
Eat this!

00:00:47.255 --> 00:00:49.674
Now tell me! Where is Zero?

00:00:49.841 --> 00:00:51.926
I hate pushy guys, you know.

00:00:52.343 --> 00:00:54.554
I see. Then die here.

00:00:57.348 --> 00:00:59.059
Any last words?

00:01:00.602 --> 00:01:02.896
Lancelot Conquista, take off!

00:01:03.021 --> 00:01:03.897
Taking off!

00:01:16.284 --> 00:01:19.204
Kallen, I have to save Nunnally.

00:01:20.080 --> 00:01:21.164
I won't ask you...

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:27.587
Impossible!

00:01:29.631 --> 00:01:30.507
Kouzuki!

00:01:33.843 --> 00:01:35.345
Pull the ejection lever, Kouzuki!

00:01:36.262 --> 00:01:37.597
No use! It won't work!

00:01:39.516 --> 00:01:40.391
I'm descending!

00:01:41.101 --> 00:01:42.560
Forgive me, Guren...

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.939
Opening number 3 vertical launch chamber.

00:01:46.022 --> 00:01:48.483
Connection signal with Guren Mk-II,
confirmed.

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:51.986
Turn around!

00:01:55.990 --> 00:01:57.117
Linking up!

00:02:01.871 --> 00:02:02.705
Fly!

00:02:06.292 --> 00:02:08.837
Continue! Armor piercing ordnance
right arm unit!

00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:12.090
Right arm unit dropping speed for linkup.

00:02:12.215 --> 00:02:15.385
Transmission neuron 0.5 to 0.8 MMP.

00:02:15.468 --> 00:02:16.845
No blockage detected.

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:20.265
Elastic muscles one through five
are operating normally.

00:02:20.348 --> 00:02:23.518
Confirm activation of shock control.
Linking up.

00:02:31.776 --> 00:02:33.194
No matter what the enemy throws at me!

00:02:36.114 --> 00:02:38.575
If this new Guren can't
handle them, it's all over!

00:02:38.825 --> 00:02:41.870
Still, you don't have much of a choice,
so why not try shooting?

00:02:41.995 --> 00:02:43.580
You've got a point there!

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:50.712
From long range?

00:02:54.757 --> 00:02:57.635
I can do it! With this
Guren Flight-Enabled Version!

00:02:58.303 --> 00:03:00.847
Kallen, you're coming back,
in this situation?

00:03:01.806 --> 00:03:03.933
Could Zero be inside the ship?

00:03:04.475 --> 00:03:06.060
Get out of my way!

00:03:06.436 --> 00:03:08.313
Have a taste of the Gefjun Net!

00:03:14.652 --> 00:03:16.070
We have a countermeasure for this!

00:03:16.988 --> 00:03:19.032
Even so, you're still stuck where you are!

00:03:21.826 --> 00:03:25.872
Impossible! I thought
they upgraded my Yggdrasil Drive!

00:03:26.122 --> 00:03:27.165
Suzaku!

00:03:27.790 --> 00:03:29.500
We've located the viceroy!

00:03:29.792 --> 00:03:32.253
She's in the garden space
to the rear of the main bridge!

00:03:32.337 --> 00:03:34.589
But you only have
47 seconds till the ship crashes!

00:03:34.672 --> 00:03:35.673
I promise, I'll save her!

00:03:37.091 --> 00:03:38.009
Damn!

00:03:46.309 --> 00:03:47.310
Confirm activation.

00:03:47.477 --> 00:03:48.853
Activation, confirmed.

00:03:49.270 --> 00:03:49.979
Guren!

00:03:50.104 --> 00:03:51.064
Launch!

00:04:04.285 --> 00:04:05.912
How do I turn this
into a close-range battle?

00:04:05.995 --> 00:04:07.705
Kallen! Finish off Suzaku now!

00:04:08.122 --> 00:04:09.624
Do that and nothing will stand in our way!

00:04:09.999 --> 00:04:10.875
-Yes, sir!

00:04:13.253 --> 00:04:14.921
It's too great...

00:04:15.421 --> 00:04:16.798
The difference in machine potential!

00:04:28.059 --> 00:04:28.977
I can't win.

00:04:30.186 --> 00:04:31.813
Goodbye, Suzaku.

00:04:32.355 --> 00:04:33.439
In that case...

00:04:33.523 --> 00:04:34.482
In that case, what?

00:04:34.565 --> 00:04:36.609
In that case,
you can't be allowed to live.

00:04:36.693 --> 00:04:39.529
I'll defeat you and stop Lelouch!

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:41.155
I won't let you do that!

00:04:45.076 --> 00:04:48.663
That's the reason
I've fought with the resistance!

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:51.374
You could have tried to work
within the system!

00:04:53.501 --> 00:04:57.380
What are you supposed to do
if you can't get into the system?

00:04:58.548 --> 00:05:01.718
How are we supposed
to tell people that it's wrong?

00:05:02.802 --> 00:05:03.678
You!

00:05:03.720 --> 00:05:06.097
How dare you act so high and mighty!

00:05:07.390 --> 00:05:10.059
What about those who have no choice
but join the system?

00:05:10.601 --> 00:05:11.602
What is justice?

00:05:21.029 --> 00:05:24.240
Still, they say that war
is the mother of invention.

00:05:24.407 --> 00:05:26.159
The people. The world.

00:05:26.242 --> 00:05:28.244
They will never be
what we want them to be!

00:05:28.286 --> 00:05:30.913
So now you're forcing them to be?

00:05:31.080 --> 00:05:31.956
That's...

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:35.668
Even the radiant wave surger
is out of ammo now.

00:05:37.587 --> 00:05:39.630
My shield energy is exhausted too.

00:05:39.797 --> 00:05:40.673
Even so...

00:05:49.849 --> 00:05:51.225
I can't beat her!

00:05:51.309 --> 00:05:53.144
Even with the curse of the Geass!

00:05:53.603 --> 00:05:55.438
Kallen, your strength is phenomenal!

00:05:55.605 --> 00:05:57.774
My machine has better specs
than yours, yet...

00:05:58.149 --> 00:06:00.526
Suzaku, even with all my strength...

00:06:00.777 --> 00:06:01.611
Why?

00:06:07.033 --> 00:06:08.785
Let's end it, Kallen!

00:06:10.370 --> 00:06:12.997
If you only had justice on your side!

00:06:24.258 --> 00:06:25.301
No.

00:06:25.968 --> 00:06:27.345
Didn't it get him?

00:06:27.512 --> 00:06:30.556
No, Kallen. You got me.

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:48.074
I see. You won, Kallen.

00:06:55.081 --> 00:06:55.957
Kallen!

00:06:56.457 --> 00:06:58.209
I'm going to stop you!

00:06:58.292 --> 00:06:59.961
Goodbye, Lelouch.

00:07:06.634 --> 00:07:08.970
Leave this to me! Get to Damocles!

00:07:09.053 --> 00:07:09.887
You stubborn...

00:07:09.971 --> 00:07:11.722
But you're no match for the Guren!

00:07:11.806 --> 00:07:14.308
I'm glad that you care, Lelouch.

00:07:18.396 --> 00:07:20.606
You have no country to defend!
Nothing to avenge!

00:07:21.065 --> 00:07:22.775
You also don't have a shred of ambition!

00:07:23.192 --> 00:07:26.404
If you have no reason to fight,
then why are you here?

00:07:26.737 --> 00:07:29.157
I have a reason to fight. A promise.

00:07:29.240 --> 00:07:31.284
Are you saying that you love Lelouch?

00:07:32.076 --> 00:07:33.244
Who knows?

00:07:33.327 --> 00:07:36.122
It's just that I thought it's time
for me to put an end

00:07:36.205 --> 00:07:38.416
to simply accumulating experiences.

00:07:38.708 --> 00:07:40.543
That makes you sound almost human!

00:07:41.752 --> 00:07:42.879
Well done.

00:07:46.799 --> 00:07:48.926
Kallen, you win.

00:07:49.469 --> 00:07:51.262
That really doesn't matter.

00:07:51.471 --> 00:07:52.388
Goodbye.

00:07:57.727 --> 00:08:02.732
Win or lose, I never thought
I still had those feelings in me.

